      "explanation": "In N<sub>2</sub>O oxidation states of\nnitrogen = +1\n<br><br>In NO oxidation states of\nnitrogen = +2\n<br><br>In N<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> oxidation states of\nnitrogen = +3\n<br><br>In NO<sub>2</sub> oxidation states of\nnitrogen = +4"
